(7629287, 1235881, 183622, '<td valign="top">I was here to take the shot of the waterfalls and people were moving around and about the area, so I used a super long exposure to keep the people out of the final image. This kid stood like a rock for the entire 13 seconds of this exposure, and I originally thought "Dang, Kid... when are you gonna move?"... which he eventually did. But when I saw how sharp(ish) he was I thought it was a really cool image and story.</td>', 'I was here to take the shot of the waterfalls and people were moving around and about the area, so I used a super long exposure to keep the people out of the final image. This kid stood like a rock for the entire 13 seconds of this exposure, and I originally thought "Dang, Kid... when are you gonna move?"... which he eventually did. But when I saw how sharp(ish) he was I thought it was a really cool image and story.', '2019-05-13 11:44:41.000000', NULL, 0);
